    "mobile": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"100%\" style=\"height:auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 330\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"nv17-diligence-en-mobile-title nv17-diligence-en-mobile-desc\" xml:lang=\"en\" data-variant=\"mobile\"><title id=\"nv17-diligence-en-mobile-title\">The due-diligence circuit</title><desc id=\"nv17-diligence-en-mobile-desc\">Due-diligence mechanism in the controls announced by BIS on 16 November 2026, section 744.24 note 3 and paragraph e. The exporter obtains and can provide sufficient information about the foreign data center’s KYC checks, including customers and their ownership or control. Refused or insufficient information creates a red flag that presumptively provides knowledge unless resolved before the transaction. Requests for documents and clarification return to the data center; no automatic clearance is shown. For a later change to a covered end use, the recipient must be informed and the operator must obtain BIS authorization under the text’s conditions.</desc><rect x=\"0.6\" y=\"0.6\" width=\"318.8\" height=\"328.8\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"var(--color-surface)\" stroke=\"var(--color-line-strong)\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"28\" font-family=\"l0g Nvidia Cloud Controls\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"var(--color-paper)\">The due-diligence circuit</text><g transform=\"translate(48 86)\" data-icon=\"racks\"><path d=\"M-22-18H-3V18H-22Z M4-18H23V18H4Z M-17-10H-8 M-17-3H-8 M-17 5H-8 M9-10H18 M9-3H18 M9 5H18 M-20 23H22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-signal)\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(160 86)\" data-icon=\"lens\"><path d=\"M-13-16H3L13-6V10H-13Z M3-16V-6H13 M-7 0H4 M-7 5H1 M13 10L22 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-signal)\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(272 86)\" data-icon=\"document\"><path d=\"M-14-20H5L16-9V20H-14Z M5-20V-9H16 M-7-1H8 M-7 6H8 M-7 13H3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-signal)\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></g><path d=\"M78 86H126\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-signal)\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-relationship=\"kyc-information\"/><path d=\"M121 82L126 86L121 90\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-signal)\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"102\" y=\"58\" font-family=\"l0g Nvidia Cloud Controls\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"var(--color-muted)\">KYC</text><path d=\"M195 86H240\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-signal)\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-relationship=\"exporter-diligence\"/><path d=\"M235 82L240 86L235 90\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-signal)\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"130\" font-family=\"l0g Nvidia Cloud Controls\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"var(--color-paper)\">Foreign</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"147\" font-family=\"l0g Nvidia Cloud Controls\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"var(--color-paper)\">data center</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"130\" font-family=\"l0g Nvidia Cloud Controls\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"var(--color-paper)\">KYC</text><text x=\"272\" y=\"130\" font-family=\"l0g Nvidia Cloud Controls\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"var(--color-paper)\">Exporter</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"169\" font-family=\"l0g Nvidia Cloud Controls\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"var(--color-muted)\">Customers · ownership · control</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"191\" font-family=\"l0g Nvidia Cloud Controls\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"var(--color-muted)\">Insufficient information</text><path d=\"M160 199V210H49\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-amber)\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-relationship=\"information-red-flag\"/><path d=\"M54 206L49 210L54 214\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-amber)\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><g transform=\"translate(36 230)\" data-icon=\"alert\"><path d=\"M0-19L21 18H-21Z M0-7V4 M0 10V12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-amber)\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></g><text x=\"63\" y=\"226\" font-family=\"l0g Nvidia Cloud Controls\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"var(--color-amber)\">Resolve the red flag</text><text x=\"63\" y=\"244\" font-family=\"l0g Nvidia Cloud Controls\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"var(--color-paper)\">before the transaction</text><path d=\"M36 252H12V156H48\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-amber)\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-relationship=\"request-clarification\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/><path d=\"M43 152L48 156L43 160\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-amber)\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M18 253H302\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-line-strong)\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"270\" font-family=\"l0g Nvidia Cloud Controls\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"var(--color-muted)\">Change to a covered end use</text><g transform=\"translate(42 288)\" data-icon=\"notice\"><path d=\"M-15-13H15V12H-15Z M-15-13L0-2L15-13 M-19 17H19\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-muted)\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(273 288)\" data-icon=\"permit\"><path d=\"M-14-20H5L16-9V20H-14Z M5-20V-9H16 M-7 4L-2 9L8-1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-amber)\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></g><path d=\"M75 288H240\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-amber)\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-relationship=\"covered-use-authorization\"/><path d=\"M235 284L240 288L235 292\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-amber)\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"42\" y=\"321\" font-family=\"l0g Nvidia Cloud Controls\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"var(--color-paper)\">Inform</text><text x=\"273\" y=\"321\" font-family=\"l0g Nvidia Cloud Controls\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"var(--color-paper)\">Authorization</text></svg>"
  }
} as const;
const captions = {
  "fr": "Contrôles annoncés le 16 novembre 2026. Des informations KYC insuffisantes créent une alerte à résoudre avant transaction. Le texte encadre aussi l’information du destinataire et l’autorisation d’un changement vers l’usage couvert.",
  "en": "Controls announced on 16 November 2026. Insufficient KYC information creates a red flag to resolve before the transaction. The text also covers recipient notification and authorization for a change to a covered end use."
} as const;
if (!['fr', 'en'].includes(lang)) throw new Error('Unknown Nvidia infographic language');
const scene = art[lang];
---
<figure class="nvidia-cloud-diligence" id={`nvidia-cloud-diligence-${lang}`}>
  <div class="scene desktop" set:html={scene.desktop}></div>
  <div class="scene mobile" set:html={scene.mobile}></div>
  <figcaption><span class="number">FIG. 02</span>{' '}{captions[lang]}{' '}<a href="#source-S01" aria-label="Source S01">[S01]</a>{' '}<a href="#source-S02" aria-label="Source S02">[S02]</a></figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  @font-face{font-family:'l0g Nvidia Cloud Controls';src:url('/fonts/ukraine-reparations/liberation-sans-400.ttf') format('truetype');font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap}
  figure{width:100%;max-width:37.5rem;margin:1.5rem auto 1.7rem;padding-bottom:1rem;container-type:inline-size}
  .scene{width:100%;max-width:100%;line-height:0}
  .mobile{display:none}
  figure :global(svg){display:block;width:100%;height:auto;max-width:100%;letter-spacing:normal}
  figcaption{margin-top:.65rem;color:var(--color-muted);font-family:var(--font-read);font-size:.75rem;line-height:1.5;font-weight:400}
  .number{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.6875rem;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--color-signal);margin-right:.4rem}
  a{display:inline-block;text-underline-offset:.18em}
  a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-signal);outline-offset:3px}
  @container(max-width:520px){.desktop{display:none}.mobile{display:block;max-width:20rem;margin-inline:auto}}
  @media print{.desktop{display:block}.mobile{display:none}figure{break-inside:avoid}}
</style>
